{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "チンさんはうちの担当になられてから", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783478966.6966338}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "もう半年近くになりますが", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783478969.0988164}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "非常によくやっていただいております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783478976.4038625}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "いえとんでもないです。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783478981.4049256}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "江藤部長には", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783478986.0334728}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "いろいろ助けていただいております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783478986.8272202}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "とも", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783478991.9326737}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "よろしくお願いいします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783478992.7849188}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "では内容を確認していきましょう。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479002.9849741}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は上司の紹介ということで、先ほど", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479007.9941485}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "勉強した談話の表現のより長いバージョンになります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479012.8277671}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "江藤さんのところ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479017.6962123}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ですね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479018.1039853}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "チンさんはうちの担当になられてからもう半年", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479023.1126797}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "近くになりますが", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479025.131325}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "という表現が加わっていますね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479029.146386}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は皆さん実際の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479030.1320503}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "状況によってここも変えることができます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479035.0185008}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "場合はうちの担当、弊社の担当に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479040.0555658}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なってから", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479040.767544}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なるの丁寧に言うと受け身形にすることで", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479045.7452886}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "丁寧になりますね。ですから担当になってから", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479049.671118}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ではなくてなられてからというとさらに", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479052.281836}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "尊敬の気持ちが表現されます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479055.6738787}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "からもう半年近くになりますが", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479060.1576397}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "何々近く、つまりこれはもうすぐ半年", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479065.1344998}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ということですね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479066.6121802}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "にこの非常にという言葉が", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479071.6121948}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "加わりました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479071.8465207}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "非常にはとても大変と同じ意味ですね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479076.845721}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "とてもよりももっと強い表現になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479080.2837985}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "期待以上に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479082.5508425}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "思った以上に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479084.330157}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "よく、えー、チンさんは働いています。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479088.0303047}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "よくいい仕事をしていますという表現", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479093.033378}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "が伝わりますね。そういう気持ちが伝わりますね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479095.633493}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "てこの表現もいろいろ助けていただいております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479100.6410048}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "の他にもいろんな表現がありましたね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479104.1386182}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "いろんな表現で", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479106.5105145}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "を入れて、そして実際の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479109.4500728}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "自分の部長の名前やお客様の名前を入れて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479114.456332}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ぜひ練習してみてください", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479116.9411082}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、ここですね。今後とも", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479121.931574}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は意味はこれからも", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479125.528996}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "を丁寧に言うと、今後ともになります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479129.653397}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "はこれからになるので、今後ともというのはこれからも", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479134.6226335}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "の丁寧、改まった表現になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479138.8333743}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ではぜひ皆さん、たくさん練習してみてください", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479143.317285}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "第3回目の最後は", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479151.3270845}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "名詞交換について勉強したいと思います。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479153.9380941}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は名刺交換をしたことがありますか。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479158.933256}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "しました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479160.751493}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "人によって", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479163.565447}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ポジションによってまあ名刺交換をよくしている", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479168.5755074}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "方もいれば", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479168.6897247}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "あまりそういう機会がない方もいるかと思いますが", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479173.724046}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "今日はその表現について一緒に確認していきたいと思います。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479176.9049625}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "名刺交換をするとき", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479181.8392792}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "どんな、どんな表現を使いますか。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479184.9464786}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479187.4397328}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "会社の名前、そして自分の名前を言います。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479192.3178225}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "何々会社の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479195.013354}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "沖田と申します。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479197.750624}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "て両手で名刺を持って", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479202.3985472}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "名前を言った後に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479205.5715048}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "どうぞよろしくお願いいたしますと言ってから", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479210.5723507}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "名詞を渡してくだい。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479211.8622684}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "何々会社の何々と申します。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479215.6138997}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "渡す前にどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479219.9026642}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "と言って名刺を渡します", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479222.9313176}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "てもらう側", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479225.3665583}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "名称をもらう側は何と言ってもらえますか", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479229.5360599}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "頂戴いたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479234.5559876}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "と言ってもらってくださいありがとうございますとか", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479237.7957149}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "いただきますという表現を使わないでくださいね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479242.758306}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "頂戴いたしますという、これはもう決まり文句になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479247.0061042}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "では皆さん", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479251.015859}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "こういった場面に遭遇したときは", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479256.0190275}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "どうしますか", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479258.4714842}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "相手に何と伝えればいいでしょうか", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479261.8620605}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、今日は", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479266.859205}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "たまたま名刺を持っていなかった", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479268.0038667}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "今新しい名刺を作っているところだとか", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479272.2897248}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "まあ今日は名刺の名刺交換をする予定がなかった時に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479277.248752}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "今手元に名刺がない時、皆さんは何と伝えますか", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479281.605283}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ときはまず落ち着いてこの表現を使ってください。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479289.1155498}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "申し訳ございません", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479292.1386387}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "あいにく本日は名刺を切らしておりまして", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479297.0209835}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "では一緒にリピートしてくだい。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479301.775246}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "申し訳ございません", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479304.0089247}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "あいにく本日は名刺を切らしておりまして", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479308.878815}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は素直に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479317.3678374}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "今日は名詞を持ってきていません。忘れていました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479319.5543613}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "名刺交換を予定してなかったので", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479324.564916}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "と素直に理由を", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479325.219296}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "相手に伝える必要はありません。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479328.0772831}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "この時は、この表現を", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479333.07648}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "決まり表現、決まり文句なのでこちらの表現を", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479336.4143744}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "使うようにしてください", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479337.4890544}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "あいにくというのは、まあ相手の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479342.4601388}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "期待に応えられないとき", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479343.702657}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "つまり今名詞、相手に渡すことができないこと", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479348.699219}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "それは期待に応えられなですよね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479350.7370055}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ながらとかそういう意味とだと思ってください、あいにく。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479355.7840767}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "て本日、これは今日改まった表現は本日", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479360.739695}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "名刺を切らしておりまして、まあ、名刺を切らす", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479365.6781044}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "つまり今在庫がない", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479370.062017}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "という表現になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479370.6378782}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "この表現を使ってください", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479374.5987787}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "て、申し訳ございません、あいにく本日は名称", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479379.6093225}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "切らしておりまして、と言った後に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479383.107894}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "自己紹介何々会社の何々と申します。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479389.6850471}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ぞよろしくお願いいたしますと", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479391.3703182}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "自己紹介をしっかりしてくだい", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479394.555012}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "本来ならこういったことにならなように", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479399.5549161}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "普段から名刺を持ち歩いておくべきですが", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479402.9594235}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "時にはこういう状況になることもあるかもしれません。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479406.189333}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "いた時はまず落ち着いてこの表現を相手に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479411.184083}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "伝えれば、うまく対応できると思います。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479415.7803562}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "こちらの表現についても覚えておいてください", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479419.4449706}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "皆さんこんにちは", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479430.147664}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.23.1-20260708-114410-a4511ee1", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "第四回のビジネス会話クラス", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783479432.5926914}
